  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, and minced garlic.",
    "Add chopped onion, carrots, zucchini, and mixed greens to the bowl. Toss to coat.",
    "Thread lamb, onion, carrots, zucchini, and mixed greens onto skewers.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until lamb reaches 145°F (63°C).",
    "Let rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
